# Componentry — Core

One-page Next.js product that sells UI / motion hero components.

## Stack
- Next.js 12 Pages Router · React 17 · Tailwind · shadcn/ui · Framer Motion · Lucide · sonner
- Theme: `AgencyThemeContext` + Dynamic Island nav (search · theme · buy)
- Catalog: `app/AgencySite/componentryCatalog.js`

## Rules
- Single route `/` only — no CRM, auth, or nested app pages
- Add components via `COMPONENTRY` registry (Cmd+K + `/?c=id`)
- Buy CTA from `agencyConfig.js` → `CHECKOUT`
- See `llm.txt` for full context
